# inc-ibzyp: the MultiSelectColorProbe stages two items under the player and
# runs the AutoLoot macro. DOWN then UP puts the cursor on each row in turn, so
# every row draws once as the cursor row and once as a plain row. ENTER takes
# the (unmarked) selection; ESC closes anything left. The @while closes a
# room-description box that a loaded old save may open first.
@while "Winding Corridor" SPACE
DOWN
UP
ENTER
@while "too large" SPACE
ESC*10
@quit
